1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,080
Chest tightness after a meal is something most of us brush off.

2
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:10,400
Usually it's just indigestion, but sometimes it's your heart asking for help.

3
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,760
In the next two minutes, I'll show you how to tell the difference.

4
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:14,400
Stick around.

5
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,040
First, the emergency signs.

6
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:22,800
Pressure or pain in your chest that spreads to your arm, neck, jaw, or back.

7
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:27,680
Shortness of breath, a cold sweat, nausea, dizziness.

8
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:31,200
Any of these call triple zero now.

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,160
So why would eating affect your heart?

10
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:39,600
After a big meal, extra blood goes to your gut, so your heart has to work harder.

11
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:44,000
If the arteries around your heart are narrowed, it can't keep up.

12
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,520
That's called angina.

13
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:47,680
Now how to tell them apart?

14
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:50,320
Heartburn burns.

15
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:54,800
It sits behind your breastbone and can rise into your throat with a sour taste.

16
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:58,080
It's often worse when you lie down or bend over.

17
00:00:58,880 --> 00:01:05,600
Heart pain squeezes, pressure, tightness, heaviness, and it can spread beyond your chest.

18
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:09,040
If you're not sure, stop. Sit down.

19
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:10,000
Rest.

20
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:16,320
If it's severe, getting worse, or not gone in 10 minutes, call triple zero.

21
00:01:16,320 --> 00:01:17,440
Don't drive yourself.

22
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:22,960
And if it keeps coming back after meals, even if it settles, see your GP.

23
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:26,880
Chest pain that keeps returning is never something to ignore.

24
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:30,880
Most of the time, it really is just indigestion.

25
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:33,120
But your heart deserves the benefit of the doubt.

26
00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:37,520
Share this with someone who always says it's just indigestion.

